# Playwright E2E conventions

- Test visible user workflows through stable roles, labels, and test IDs instead of brittle CSS selectors.
- Use Playwright's built-in assertions and auto-waiting; never add arbitrary sleep calls.
- Isolate test data and clean up external state so tests can run in any order.
- Keep each test independent and record traces, screenshots, or videos only when they aid failure diagnosis.
